   "text": "Basis examples: 'Plan Sales / Invoices Sep–Nov 2026' · 'Fallback: Requested production Sep–Nov 2026' · FGNI at plant × MK: 'mapped through the bridge by request share'. Rejected rows: 'No spread basis — counted as missing'.",
   "originalText": "Basis examples: 'Plan Sales / Invoices Sep–Nov 2026' · 'Fallback: Requested production Sep–Nov 2026' · FGNI at plant × MK: 'mapped through the bridge by request share'. Rejected rows: 'No spread basis — counted as missing'.",
   "fontSize": 8,
